  "proposal": "For actual compact smooth W in R^d with d<=7, use Cauchy-Schwarz plus Plancherel and (Id-Delta)^2 instead of the tensor L1 by fourteen derivatives. Candidate uniform FourierL1 cost is C*(1+R)^4, then one squared Gram costs (1+R)^8. d=2 may use Id-Delta and order2.",
